Comment: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:17.10,translation **,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chu chu paya shalalala! Chu chu paya shalalala!
Comment: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:21.94,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chu chu paya shalalala! No way! A bug?! Oh, girls
Comment: 0,0:00:22.59,0:00:27.16,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Number one in delusion skills, the whole place starts to buzz
Comment: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:32.10,translation *,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}DI-swords only in this fight, but good luck getting screentime
Comment: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:36.96,translation *,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Orgel in the anime's the strongest, but a figure's all you get
Comment: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:44.43,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}The more you pull the trigger, the bigger the New Gen: a realboot of love!
Comment: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:47.95,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Megalo? Gigalo? Nothing but wordplay, y'know?
Comment: 0,0:00:47.97,0:00:50.08,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}It's your favorite cutie-Pi that decides how this ends
Comment: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:55.03,translation **,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chaos girls are breaking news across the world, even on Shibuya's screens
Comment: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:57.70,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Big twists incoming, but leave the loops for other stories,
Comment: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:00.46,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}the Dirac sea is opening up here
Comment: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:05.45,translation *,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}It's time for the love battle that's been built up since the intro
Comment: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:08.30,translation *,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}When our eyes meet, it's an oh-so-in-love move!
Comment: 0,0:01:08.30,0:01:10.76,translation *,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}On social media, it's a cryptic move!
Comment: 0,0:01:10.76,0:01:15.76,translation *,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Every single move is way too lovely, oh, way too lovely!
Comment: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:20.60,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}A fake Like move! A heart-hint move!
Comment: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:25.46,translation **,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Countless moves are the magic that draws you in
Comment: 0,0:01:25.66,0:01:29.93,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Way too lovely, way too lovely, doesn't chaos feel just right?
Comment: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:33.62,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Whose eyes are those eyes? They're my eyes!
Comment: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:35.39,translation **,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chu! Chu! Chu!
Comment: 0,0:01:35.54,0:01:38.54,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Even in a world line where everyone's in love
Comment: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:40.29,translation **,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chu! Chu! Chu!
Comment: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:47.20,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Welcome to the true end of... the New World Order!
Comment: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:53.09,translation **,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chu chu paya shalalala! Chu chu paya shalalala!
Comment: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:58.01,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chu chu paya shalalala! No way! A bug?! Oh, girls
